Bklit UI heatmap source
https://github.com/bklit/bklit-ui
https://ui.bklit.com/r/heatmap-chart.json
Upstream private source package: @bklitui/ui 0.0.0 (registry source, not an npm release).
Heatmap registry JSON snapshot SHA-256 (JSON.stringify):
b48e10a65a6fe39c413a072783facc4d98904b8cbf3af3aaf8278b257a8a0007
Individual original source hashes and registry origins are recorded in each source file.
Local adaptations: cn import location, heatmap-only shared context and pattern exports,
UTC date formatting, explicit month ticks, deterministic empty-domain fallback,
commit-phase lifecycle ref synchronization, reactive DOM-measured tooltip sizes,
and keyboard/focus access to the genuine Bklit/visx SVG cells.
Pattern primitives retain their additional MIT attribution in patterns/LICENSE-visx-pattern.

